## After writing

1. Update CHAPTER_ARCHITECTURE.md: change this chapter's STATUS from PENDING to DRAFT COMPLETE
2. Update STATE_LEDGER.md with end-of-chapter state
3. Update CLUE_LEDGER.md: mark planted clues as PLANTED
4. Run this filter-verb check before committing, and REVISE if over budget — do not skip this step:
   grep -nE "\b(was|were|had been|felt|seemed|appeared|looked)\b" manuscript/chapter-*.md | wc -l
   Budget: ≤40 filter verbs per 4,000 words of the chapter you just wrote. If over, revise: replace filter verbs with specific physical actions before committing.
5. Commit to draft/contact-zero-book3 with message: "feat(long-silence): chapter [N] [title] — [word count]w"
6. Push to origin: git push origin draft/contact-zero-book3

## Canon compliance (LOCKED — these cannot be violated)

- Standard Eight = Coupling. Aaron can join incompatible field systems without catastrophic interference.
- The Node does not speak in words, even at its fullest disclosure in Chapters 7–8.
- Elin Casaus is a civilian, never read into the classified program. What Aaron tells her (Ch16) is genuine and incomplete by design and by her own informed choice — not a lie, not full disclosure.
- Rhys steps down (Ch12) — health-driven withdrawal, NOT death. He is alive at Book 3's close unless a later canon decision changes this.
- Kade is born in Chapter 23 and does NOT appear as a developed character on-page — the book ends at or shortly after his birth. Do not age him up.
- Aaron's classification formalizes (Ch22) in the same season as Kade's birth (Ch23) — these two events must land together per series bible, not years apart.
- CRITICAL — do not contradict the Asterion Trilogy's eventual reveal (cross-reference in BOOK_BIBLE.md): 31 years after this trilogy, Aaron is alive, sealed in a chamber, sustaining containment around the Refuge Node. Nothing in Book 3 may write an ending incompatible with this — no character death for Aaron, no full retirement from the Node relationship, no permanent severing of his connection to the coupling work. His classification is an erasure from PUBLIC record, not from the actual ongoing work.
- Boundary Field physics: humans don't create energy from nothing — Resonant effects redefine which systems may exchange momentum/energy/charge/entropy over short intervals.

